# Keep the build context small. Written with Claude Code (Anthropic) assistance.
.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.cache
**/.pytest_cache
docs
media
*.md

# Nothing private or local ever goes into the build, even if it sits in the folder.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/service-account*.json
**/*credentials*.json
**/.claude
CLAUDE.local.md
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/*.log
